    "detailed_description": "<strong>Happy Hour Hero is a cartoony, flow-state bartending game that boasts:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Four core modes - Happy Hour, Easy Casual, Normal Casual, and Hardcore!<br></li><li>Two minigames - Dart Attack and Bowling!<br></li><li>Seven drinks to master and a full bar to keep stocked!<br></li><li>Four leaderboards to climb!<br></li><li>Options for all playstyles - seated, standing, and roomscale. Smooth motion, snap turning, and teleportation!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684030/extras/880948697698ca4666372ab4c1883fe7.avif?t=1708116104\" width=580 height=300 /></span><br>We\u2019ve not had a lot of luck hiring competent bar staff, but I have a feeling you\u2019re the right one for the job. Keep the beer stocked, the spirits flowing, and the customers merry. Oh, and if you mess up, it\u2019s coming out of your paycheck. It gets pretty busy, so just stay on your toes and don\u2019t get mixed up. Alright? Welcome to the team.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684030/extras/01e9a57d586c3c5338c6497b437d5afe.poster.avif?t=1708116104\" width=610 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684030/extras/01e9a57d586c3c5338c6497b437d5afe.webm?t=1708116104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2684030/extras/01e9a57d586c3c5338c6497b437d5afe.mp4?t=1708116104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Test your spirits!</strong><br><br>If your shift goes well, you might just earn a spot on the global leaderboards. Fancy yourself a pro-mixer? Join the highballers in hardcore mode.<br><br><strong>On-the-job training!</strong><br><br>Not feeling competitive? Play in casual mode and serve customers who couldn\u2019t care less!<br><br><strong>Customers getting you down?</strong><br><br>Take part in teambuilding activities and compete with your colleagues - score high in darts or smash bottles in the bowling alley - drinks on the loser!<br><br><strong>Get your hands dirty!</strong><br><br>We built this bar from the ground up for VR, so you'd better make it a success!",
